### 抽出内容:

**SI. Study Identification Part**
- **Study ID**: Lamsma2024
- **Reference Files**: Lamsma2024.pdf.md; media-1.pdf.md
- **Author/Journal/Year**: Lamsma et al., medRxiv preprint, 2024
- **Title**: Structural brain abnormalities and aggressive behaviour in schizophrenia: Mega-analysis of data from 2095 patients and 2861 healthy controls via the ENIGMA consortium

**NM2. Normative Modeling 2nd Part**
